    "RowId": 6307,
    "Text": "Once removed, fixtures can no longer be put up for sale.\n<span style=\"color: #ff8080;\">The following may also result in loss of items:\n  - The removal of said item by another player\n  - Leaving or being discharged from the free\n  company\n  - Unsharing an estate\n  - The demolition of an estate</span>\n\nEstate exterior fixtures can, at any time,\nbe removed and returned to your inventory.\nApplying new exterior fixtures will automatically\nremove existing fixtures and return those to your\ninventory as well.\n\nSelect “Confirm” to finalize all changes."
